# SCORM 1.2

Zip the folder contents so `imsmanifest.xml` is at the zip root and every file is listed. Schema version is 1.2. `masteryscore` 70 belongs only on the safety challenge.

Runtime order: `LMSInitialize` → `lesson_status` `incomplete` → score min/max/raw → status → `LMSCommit` → `session_time` → `LMSFinish` once. Also finish on `pagehide`. Never call `LMSFinish` twice. If no API exists, log and return; do not throw.

- Feedback scenario: on debrief, `score.raw = round(total/30×100)`, status `completed`. No pass/fail.
- Safety challenge: on results or game over, `score.raw` from base points / 1000, status `passed` if ≥ 70 else `failed`.
- Retry overwrites the score only when the new score is higher.
- `xapi-stub.js` may `console.info` statements. Do not set an endpoint or put credentials in the repo.
- Interactions (`cmi.interactions.*`) are optional and must sit in try/catch.

```js
// ❌ BAD: finish on every screen, throw when standalone
api.LMSFinish("");

// ✅ GOOD
if (!SCORM.isLMS()) { /* show saved_standalone */ }
else { SCORM.score(raw); SCORM.status("completed"); SCORM.commit(); }
// «إنهاء النشاط» and pagehide call SCORM.finish() once
```
